# === CATCH-ALL — show ANY item not explicitly defined above, so nothing unknown is ever missed ===
# Loud magenta = "unclassified, review me and add a proper rule". Normal/Magic trash is already
# hidden by the rule above; this catches unrecognized currency/unique/special/new-content types.
Show
    SetFontSize 40
    SetTextColor 255 0 255 255
    SetBorderColor 255 0 255 255
    SetBackgroundColor 50 0 50 255
    MinimapIcon 1 Pink Kite
    PlayEffect Pink
